{
  // Schema: { "<resource owner>": { "<localized filename>": ["<resource key>", ...] } }
  // Owners: SqlClient (driver resources) and Abstractions (authentication resources).
  // Each owner maps Strings.<culture>.resx filenames to arrays of approved resource keys.
  // An empty owner object means no exceptions. Omit files that need no exceptions.
  // The validator reads only the selected owner; a missing owner section is an error.
  // Filenames and keys are case-sensitive and must exist in the selected resource set.
  // Keys must be non-empty, unique within each file's array, and have non-empty English values.
  // An exception permits only an exact English-value match in that one owner and culture.
  // It cannot exempt missing keys, empty translations, or keys absent from Strings.resx.
  //
  // These culture/key pairs intentionally match the English source text.
  // Each pair was verified in the internal LCL source as localized (Stat=Loc, Orig=New).
  // Remove an entry when its localized value changes.
